4333674228665869889_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qLdtko8n3QgQ7kNvwG-lPHB&_nc_oc=Adk2W4yqhjuTjuoCJS7aM_SHki2VNItkDWVeHk3r6wC6aX5Q8GqER8LhJYL_CrzNSEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu9dA0TQZk7aej1HSukgvYmeU5SyFc7hzBeg8HxPZosnQ&oe=6999B059"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Volta", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Volta is a new way to experience music. Transport yourself into the mind of your favorite artist as they perform live in an audio-reactive world. \n\nIn Volta, the bass of the kick drum transforms into a ripple spreading across a galactic landscape around you - every note of a synthesizer triggers a multi-colored ribbon streaking across a vapor wave Sonoran desert - your favorite artist surrounds you as crystal fragments that literally shatter around you as the sing louder and louder.\n\nIn Volta, experience itself is an artist's canvas - dance, play, interact and create alongside them in their universe.", "short_description": "Volta is a new way to experience music. Transport yourself into the mind of your favorite artist as they perform live in an audio-reactive world. \n\nIn Volta, the bass of the kick drum transforms into a ripple spreading across a galactic landscape around you - every note of a synthesizer triggers a multi-colored ribbon streaking across a vapor wave Sonoran desert - your favorite artist surrounds you as crystal fragments that literally shatter around you as the sing louder and louder."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://volta-xr.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Privacy-Policy_vMR_240321.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Volta Audio", "support_website_url": "https://volta-xr.com/", "website_url": "https://volta-xr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics